  "description": "Ultra high-performance CSV parser and writer for .NET 8+. Features SIMD-accelerated parsing (AVX-512/AVX2/NEON), zero-allocation design, RFC 4180 compliance, and fluent APIs. Writing is 2-5x faster than Sep with 35-85% less memory. Includes async streaming, source generators for AOT, LINQ-style extensions, progress reporting, and custom type converters. No external dependencies.",
